# Paste a token from POST /api/users/auth/login (never commit real tokens)
@token = PASTE_YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### My wishlist (newest first, X-Total-Count header)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/wishlist?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Save a product (saving it twice is fine)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/wishlist/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Remove a product
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/wishlist/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
